sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Agent
  participant E as Enforcement API
  participant DB as Shared authoritative store
  participant B as Signed HTTP backend
  participant L as Independent ledger
  A->>E: Typed operation and idempotency key
  E->>DB: Verify identity, tenant, current lineage
  E->>DB: Acquire shared transaction fence
  E->>DB: Read current route and active policy
  E->>E: Explicit deny precedes scoped allow
  alt Sensitive approved operation
    E->>DB: Check exact digest, expiry, separate reviewer
    E->>DB: Consume approval and reserve stable execution
  else Prohibited or approval missing
    E->>DB: Record denial or review-required event
    E-->>A: Deny before backend effect
  end
  opt Authorized dispatch
    E->>B: Fixed handler with request-bound HMAC
    B->>L: Independent tenant, schema and execution dedupe
    L-->>B: Durable synthetic effect/result
    B-->>E: Success or ambiguous network outcome
    E->>DB: Execution state, audit and durable outbox
    E->>DB: Commit and release fence
    E-->>A: Actual recorded state, never invented success
  end
  Note over DB,L: Separate transactions with stable backend IDs and reconciliation for ambiguity
